---

TYPE: Type of change. Common values:
- feat: a new feature
- fix: patches a bug
- docs: documentation-only changes
- refactor: code changes that neither fix a bug nor add a feature
- perf: improves performance
- test: adds or correct tests
- chore: changes to the build process or auxiliary tools

---

SCOPE [OPTIONAL]: Specific affected project area

---

SHORT_DESCRIPTION: Introduction commit description that must not exceed 50 characters

---

LONG_DESCRIPTION: Explanation (why) of changes. Use multiple lines. Each one of them must not exceed 70 characters

---

ISSUES [OPTIONAL]: Specific must-to-fix issues for next changes

---

REFERENCE_SPECIFICATION: Keep this style:

USERNAME: DATE
